'''Flower Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained by repeatedly dragging the cat-paw doorknob in the [[Cat Base Menu]]. A "meow" informs you that it is done correctly. You also need to repeat the action somewhat quickly. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] grants Area Attacks and a guaranteed Freeze chance. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], the amount of repeatedly dragging the cat-paw doorknob in the Cat Base Menu is 100 times.

